  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation, protection and management of most important nesting beaches of Cape Verde Loggerhead Rockery involving local community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will set up field camps at Ervatao and Porto Ferreira beaches to conduct patrols to protect nests and nesting females throughout the loggerhead nesting season as well as conduct outreach and education activities with local communities. The USFWS will work closely with grantee in setting goals, priorities, and developing budgets, and will provide assistance as needed and requested in engaging with National Governmental and other institutions to improve collaboration and conservation outcomes. USFWS will also provide assistance as necessary to ensure effective collaboration and cooperation between all MTCA grant recipients working within Cape Verde.</narrative>
  </description>
